    "unsupported_rule": "no-confidence-and-no-confidence-policy-allocation; other-policy-results-remain-explicit",
    "support_nonclaim": "30 units gives finite rank resolution, not proven independence, precise conditional coverage, or useful radius",
    "transport_nonclaim": "modern04-trained model applied ex-post to historical03; no fitted-model uncertainty or unseen-regime coverage"
